# ✈️ Airline Customer Satisfaction Analysis

Excel-based airline customer satisfaction analysis focused on Business Class experience, customer segmentation, flight distance patterns and actionable business insights.

## Project Scope

- Business Class satisfaction analysis
- Satisfaction Map
- Class vs Flight Distance analysis
- Age & Gender segmentation
- Departure / Arrival Time Convenience analysis
- Business insights and strategic recommendations

## Key Findings

- Business Class customers show strong satisfaction with operational services such as Baggage Handling and Inflight Service.
- Inflight Entertainment and Seat Comfort are the main improvement opportunities.
- 56.3% of Business Class passengers are concentrated in long-haul flights.
- Gender differences are limited, while age segments provide more meaningful differentiation.
- Departure / Arrival Time Convenience cannot be explained by delay duration alone.

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Customer Segmentation
- Satisfaction Mapping
- Data Visualization
- Business Insight Generation
